{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "For the Part Provision Team, the first step is to identify the parts."
      ],
      "justification": "Implicit process start and direct mapping to the first identified action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the team needs to elicit information from the customer, they should then check the availability of the parts."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the XOR decision, the affirmative condition guard (represented by v1='Yes'), and the resulting checking action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "On the other hand, if they already have the availability information, they can proceed with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps to the negative branch condition and the point where the flow rejoins to continue."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->c2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the parts are supplied to the customer, the team can also continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Represents the alternative/negative path of the second decision and its subsequent merge."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n6",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if they need to record the customer's details, they should order and receive the part from Disuki."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the second XOR decision, its affirmative condition guard (v2='Yes'), and the ordering/receiving action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the part is received, the team can then contract the customer."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct correspondence to the contracting step following part receipt."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After all the necessary parts are collected, the team can proceed with the payment."
      ],
      "justification": "Matches the payment action occurring post-collection/synchronization."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the payment is made, the process comes to an end."
      ],
      "justification": "Explicit final action and process termination."
    }
  ],
